---
import DemoLayout from '../../../components/demos/DemoLayout.astro';
import Art from '../../../components/demos/Art.astro';
import LocalEnquiry from '../../../components/demos/LocalEnquiry.astro';
const timetable={Monday:[['06:30','Strength foundations','45 min','Technique focus'],['12:15','Move & reset','30 min','Mobility'],['18:00','Engine room','45 min','Conditioning']],Wednesday:[['07:00','Build your base','45 min','Strength'],['12:15','Move & reset','30 min','Mobility'],['17:30','Team circuit','45 min','Conditioning']],Saturday:[['08:00','Weekend strength','50 min','Strength'],['09:15','Engine room','45 min','Conditioning'],['10:15','Slow it down','30 min','Mobility']]};
---
<DemoLayout slug="performance-fitness">
  <section class="demo-hero d-shell"><div class="hero-copy"><p class="d-kicker">Your pace. Your starting point.</p><h1>Show up.<br />Build<br />momentum.</h1><p class="d-lead">A studio concept for people who want a clear plan, purposeful sessions and room to find their rhythm.</p><a class="d-button" href="#trial">Explore a trial session ↗</a></div><div class="hero-media"><Art name="fitness-hero" alt="AI-generated concept image of a fictional adult athlete lifting a kettlebell in a training studio" eager sizes="100vw" /><p class="art-caption">AI-generated studio concept / No real classes</p></div></section>
  <div class="fitness-marquee">STRENGTH / CONDITIONING / MOBILITY</div>
  <section class="d-section d-shell" id="programs"><div class="d-section-head"><div><p class="d-kicker">01 / Find your focus</p><h2>Training with direction.</h2></div><p>Sample program categories demonstrate clear choices. They are not personalised training or health advice.</p></div><div class="d-grid-3">{[['fitness-one','Strength','Controlled movement, clear progressions and space to learn the fundamentals.'],['fitness-two','Conditioning','Structured intervals and varied session formats, adapted through a real coach’s guidance.'],['fitness-three','Mobility','A quieter session format centred on movement, range and body awareness.']].map(([a,t,p])=><article><Art name={a} alt={`Original ${t.toLowerCase()} training concept image`} /><div class="d-card"><h3>{t}</h3><p>{p}</p></div></article>)}</div></section>
  <section class="d-section d-shell" id="timetable"><div class="d-section-head"><div><p class="d-kicker">02 / Make room for the work</p><h2>Your week, in motion.</h2></div><p>Choose a day to explore the sample timetable. Times are illustrative and cannot be booked.</p></div><div data-switcher><div class="filter-buttons" role="group" aria-label="Choose timetable day">{Object.keys(timetable).map((day,i)=><button data-switch={day} type="button" aria-pressed={i===0?'true':'false'}>{day}</button>)}</div>{Object.entries(timetable).map(([day,rows],i)=><div class="timetable-rows" data-panel={day} hidden={i!==0} aria-label={`${day} sample classes`}>{rows.map(([time,t,d,f])=><article class="timetable-row"><span>{time}</span><h3>{t}</h3><p>{d}</p><p>{f}</p></article>)}</div>)}</div></section>
  <section class="d-section d-shell"><p class="d-kicker">03 / People behind the sessions</p><h2>Support for every session.</h2><div class="d-grid-3">{[['Strength coach','A profile layout for a coach’s approach, experience and verified qualifications.'],['Conditioning coach','A space to explain session style and how a coach supports different starting points.'],['Movement coach','A way to introduce the person behind mobility and movement sessions.']].map(([t,p])=><article class="coach"><h3>{t}</h3><p>{p}</p><span class="demo-note">Fictional role layout · No trainer credentials claimed</span></article>)}</div></section>
  <section class="d-section d-shell" id="memberships"><div class="d-section-head"><div><p class="d-kicker">04 / Find your rhythm</p><h2>A plan that fits.</h2></div><p>Compare sample access models. Pricing, availability and terms would be provided by a real studio.</p></div><div class="plan-picker" data-switcher><div class="filter-buttons" role="group" aria-label="Membership comparison view"><button type="button" data-switch="overview" aria-pressed="true">Plan overview</button><button type="button" data-switch="compare" aria-pressed="false">Compare access</button></div><div class="d-grid-3" data-panel="overview"><article class="d-card"><p class="d-kicker">A starting point</p><h3>Foundations</h3><ul><li>Two sample sessions per week</li><li>A consistent weekly routine</li><li>Introductory conversation</li></ul></article><article class="d-card"><p class="d-kicker">A regular rhythm</p><h3>Momentum</h3><ul><li>Four sample sessions per week</li><li>Mix of program categories</li><li>Routine review conversation</li></ul></article><article class="d-card"><p class="d-kicker">Room to choose</p><h3>Open pace</h3><ul><li>Flexible sample attendance</li><li>All sample program categories</li><li>Plan around your week</li></ul></article></div><div class="table-scroll" data-panel="compare" hidden><table class="demo-table"><caption>Illustrative membership comparison · No memberships for sale</caption><thead><tr><th scope="col">Access</th><th scope="col">Foundations</th><th scope="col">Momentum</th><th scope="col">Open pace</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Weekly sessions</th><td>2</td><td>4</td><td>Flexible</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Program choice</th><td>Selected</td><td>All categories</td><td>All categories</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">First conversation</th><td>Included in concept</td><td>Included in concept</td><td>Included in concept</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></section>
  <section class="d-section d-shell"><div class="d-grid-2"><div><p class="d-kicker">05 / A goal you can describe</p><h2>Start where you are.</h2></div><div><p class="d-lead">Build a routine. Explore strength. Make space to move.</p><p>These are conversation starters, not promised outcomes. In a real studio, a qualified professional would help assess suitability and agree a plan with you.</p></div></div></section>
  <section class="d-section d-shell"><LocalEnquiry id="trial" title="Find your starting point." kind="trial enquiry" options={['Build a routine','Explore strength','Try conditioning','Make time for mobility']} /></section>
</DemoLayout>
